control.</FONT></B> <BR><B><FONT size=-1>Sample population means +/- S<I>D. 

</I>Values followed by different letters are significant at 

P&lt;0.05.</FONT></B> <BR>&nbsp; <BR><FONT size=-1>&nbsp;</FONT> 

